{"ref":"BDB, חֶ֫רֶס³","hw":"חֶ֫רֶס³","html":"† III. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫רֶס</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] an eruptive disease, <strong>itch (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חַרְסָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܶܪܣܳܐ</span>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܪܘܽܣ</span> <em>rough</em>, etc.<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">וּבֶחָ֑רֶס</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.27\">Dt 28:27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עפלים</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרָב</span>),—i, ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶס</span> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, חרס\" href=\"/BDB,_חרס\", dir=\"rtl\">חרס</a>.","next":"BDB, חרסות","prev":"BDB, חֲרֶשֶׂת"}